{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44269","headline":"代人悼亡 · 鱼玄机","name":"代人悼亡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾覩夭桃想玉姿，带风杨柳认蛾眉。\n珠归龙窟知谁见，镜在鸾台话向谁。\n从此梦悲烟雨夜，不堪吟苦寂寥时。\n西山日落东山月，恨想无因有了期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鱼玄机","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}